{"id":"vod_sn_149974","vodId":"149974","provider":"sn","providerName":"索尼资源","type":2,"name":"地狱模式～喜欢速通游戏的玩家在废设定异世界无双～第二季","name_cn":"地狱模式～喜欢速通游戏的玩家在废设定异世界无双～第二季","date":"2026-01-01","year":"2026","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"全13集","images":{"common":"https://snzypic.vip/upload/vod/20260704-1/9a2a0fc975a6c5d5a21df0637a168af5.jpg"},"summary":"在无名网络游戏的世界中，转生到最高难度“地狱模式”的前废人玩家少年亚莲。没有攻略本，没有论坛。连练级都是赌上性命——面对如此绝望的环境，他身为玩家的本能却为之雀跃。\r\n凭借转生时获得的独一无二且充满谜团的才能“召唤士”的能力，以及前世的知识，一次次突破死线的亚莲，虽出身农奴，却得以成为贵族格兰威尔家的“客人”。\r\n而新的舞台——拉塔什王国学园都市。在学园中等待着的是新的伙伴、与人类最强勇者赫米奥斯的相遇，以及梦寐以求的组队攻略地下城……等等。\r\n然而这个世界无论走到哪里都是“地狱模式”。在新的舞台上，前废人玩家将展开超高难度的异世界冒险谭——大幕再次拉开。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2026-09-26 09:32:43","playable":true,"episodeCount":13,"playGroups":[{"name":"snm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v13.rstu6.com/202607/04/gcPqwqrn5Q27/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v14.rstu6.com/202607/11/Ud9atLKEGP27/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v14.rstu6.com/202607/18/JHfNHuVJ9B27/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v14.rstu6.com/202607/25/uLgQb3BQax27/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v14.rstu6.com/202608/01/Bz9JsU47kv27/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v14.rstu6.com/202608/08/kqjxFQf85h27/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v14.rstu6.com/202608/15/BqK1nyjMz927/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v13.rstu6.com/202608/22/L12TMyDgUY27/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v14.rstu6.com/202608/29/FWUuheXTv827/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v15.rstu6.com/202609/05/nib2UBkzWy27/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v15.rstu6.com/202609/12/uQcCHUQ3Xt27/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v15.rstu6.com/202609/19/ShnNFwZ3Cp27/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://v14.rstu6.com/202609/26/S4jKKEPeYS27/video/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T15:44:36.23